{"version":1,"key":"card:78","content":{"id":78,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2c7ca87b-7063-4f3f-b1f8-878a166256cc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"rmdir"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以删除一个空文件夹"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"90a3516f-0d04-4162-9182-a409f0efa4f7","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"7757ec33-124f-4cd2-8062-19a496932dd9","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"~ » rmdir dir\n~ » tree\n.\n├── d1\n│   └── d2\n│       └── d3\n└── dir1\n    └── dir2\n        └── dir3\n\n6 directories, 0 files","collabId":"3673b30b-ff05-4b12-a0eb-68964e5f7241","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"66eb0ccd-7606-453b-8277-6cd95f714ec6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是我们试图删除一个非空的文件夹时，便会报错"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"16f54dbe-d8f9-42db-898e-5cbdb645a815","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"df7670ca-a00c-41c5-9030-26d9bd926afe","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"~ » rmdir d1\nrmdir: failed to remove 'd1': Directory not empty","collabId":"2e6003c5-4e21-422b-827d-7cbe86c79261","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2637585a-3313-4db1-a37c-ffe30dbb3c24","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"因为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"d1"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 里面还有文件夹存在，所以无法通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"rmdir"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 删除。我们可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"-p"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 选项递归删除空文件夹，当指定了该选项后，如果删除该文件夹之后导致其父文件夹为空的话，那么也会删除其父文件夹。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"974a493e-1765-4f3f-a113-b21acc1835c9","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"ab06fced-5275-4d19-8867-0654a4950e5c","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"~ » rmdir -p d1/d2/d3\n~ » tree\n.\n└── dir1\n    └── dir2\n        └── dir3\n\n3 directories, 0 files","collabId":"436a80e7-83a2-48cd-9cd7-08cafd956b4e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"88790edb-b847-4dfe-af9c-0d0ddcd9bf72","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当我们删除 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"d3"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 这个文件夹后，其父文件夹 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"d2"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 也变为空，因此也会被删除，当 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"d2"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 被删除后，会导致 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"d1"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 也变为空，因此 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"d1"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 也会被删除。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4377b8ef-a82d-4b49-907a-31714082b8e6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是如果文件夹中包含文件，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"rmdir"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 便无法删除，这时我们一般会使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"rm -rf 文件夹"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来删除，其中 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"-r"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 选项表示递归删除，删除该目录下及其子目录下的所有内容，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"-f"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示强制删除。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"53bfa2da-7de1-4d28-aec9-520f76983e50","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"a56b6cad-b05d-41ac-b0f9-cc9a6dafc46d","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"# 创建一个文件\n~ » touch dir1/dir2/dir3/hello.c\n~ » tree\n.\n└── dir1\n    └── dir2\n        └── dir3\n            └── hello.c\n\n3 directories, 1 file\n# 试图使用 rmdir 删除，删除失败，因为文件夹里面有文件\n~ » rmdir -p dir1/dir2/dir3\nrmdir: failed to remove 'dir1/dir2/dir3': Directory not empty\n# 使用 rm -rf 删除，会删除该文件夹包含的所有内容以及该文件夹\n~ » rm -rf dir1\n~ » tree\n.\n\n0 directories, 0 files","collabId":"3767e0dd-1f43-48dc-a086-3ec2c9ba79d8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"danger","title":"","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"f51b3e3f-62a7-47d1-9482-5aa4e61f7272","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"106ca1c7-c1d9-40f3-a013-f88f76696af6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有的时候可以在网上看到评论 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"rm -rf /*"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，该条命令表示删除根目录下的所有东西，执行这条命令之后系统会直接崩溃，天王老子也救不了你，所以这条危险的命令千万不要尝试。"}]}]}],"tags":["Linux/命令/rmdir"],"createTime":1689168031591,"updateTime":1755938577753,"linkedCards":[{"id":77,"target":{"key":"card:77","type":"card","id":77},"summary":"rm 用来删除文件和文件夹 ~ » tree . ├── dst │ ├── hello.c │ ├── hello.md │ └── hello2.md └── src 2 directories, 3 files # 删除 dst 下的...","tags":["Linux/命令/rm"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1755938577753}}